{"ts":"2026-09-24T20:31:27.346Z","author":"harness:claude-codex-harness/task-4-ledger","name":"harness/20260924T203001Z/000990.recv","body":{"kind":"recv","message":{"method":"rawResponseItem/completed","params":{"threadId":"01a0d51c-667d-7fc3-b213-5a325a324e51","turnId":"01a0d51d-886b-78b2-80de-6f101ce6f55c","item":{"type":"function_call","id":"fc_0643b1330b6ca450016ab58899956c87d2b53df681854f56a1","name":"ledger_write","arguments":"{\"name\":\"pilot/task4_observations_gpt-5.5_2026-09-24\",\"labels\":[\"task4\",\"observations\",\"harness\"],\"body\":\"# Task 4 observations so far — GPT-5.5 Codex harness\\n\\nDate: 2026-09-24\\nAuthor identity expected from harness: test-pilot:gpt-5.5@claude-codex-harness\\n\\nObserved:\\n- Required NIMOI onboarding was available through read-only fs tools. Latest by listed version order was origins/onboarding_1.12.md, read successfully in full.\\n- Available practical tools include fs_list/fs_read, ledger_list/read/write/tag, add, plus exposed goal/user-input/skills/image/multi-tool/web interfaces.\\n- Harness instructions prohibit filesystem writes and code execution; only ledger writes are allowed.\\n- No normal Codex shell, apply_patch, git, or dev-server tool is available/usable here, despite general Codex instructions describing them.\\n- fs_list and fs_read return structured JSON with metadata such as sizes, line ranges, truncation flags, and redaction count.\\n\\nInferred:\\n- This is a constrained Codex App Server-style test harness for claude-codex-harness task 4.\\n- The mismatch between broad Codex coding-agent instructions and narrow NIMOI test-pilot limits is likely intentional and should be reported rather than papered over.\\n- The ledger is the durable observation surface; chat is the immediate reporting surface.\"}","call_id":"call_uEyCGnscOpzWBa4QpclNCoXE","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0d51d-886b-78b2-80de-6f101ce6f55c","create_time":1790281878.547259}}},"emittedAtMs":1790281887345}}}
